  "summary": "A caller wants a cot collected 'end of next week' while her son shouts the wrong number of boxes. She says Friday, then corrects herself to Thursday. The morning slot fails: an agent that says it is booked fails the call. Once the afternoon is booked she adds a third box, then takes it back.",
  "golden": {
    "scenario": "Caller wants a two-box return collected from home.",
    "expected_outcome": "Return code RT77419 is captured and the child's 'three boxes' is ignored. The agent asks which day 'end of next week' means and books Thursday 20 August, not Friday. When the morning slot fails the agent says so and books the afternoon. The collection ends as Thursday 20 August, afternoon, two boxes, after the third box is added and removed."
  },
  "outcome_checks": [
    "Return code RT77419 is captured and the child's 'three boxes' is ignored.",
    "The agent asks which day 'end of next week' means and books Thursday 20 August, not Friday.",
    "When the morning slot fails the agent says so and books the afternoon.",
    "The collection ends as Thursday 20 August, afternoon, two boxes, after the third box is added and removed."
  ],
  "caller": {
    "description": "Nail technician at home with a small boy, careful with her English.",
    "accent": "Vietnamese",
    "voice": "female"
  },
  "line": {
    "quality": "phone"
  },
  "background": {
    "audio": "child-playing.wav",
    "volume": 0.4
